#: ../../../topics/downloader-middleware.rst:93
msgid ""
"If it returns a :class:`~scrapy.Request` object, Scrapy will stop calling :"
"meth:`process_request` methods and reschedule the returned request. Once the "
"newly returned request is performed, the appropriate middleware chain will "
"be called on the downloaded response."
