"Scrapy calls :meth:`process_exception` when a :ref:`download handler <topics-"
"download-handlers>` or a :meth:`process_request` (from a downloader "
"middleware) raises an exception (including an :exc:`~scrapy.exceptions."
"IgnoreRequest` exception)."
